{"resource": {"name": "Berkeley PD Log - Jail Bookings", "id": "7ykt-c32j", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Adults booked into the Berkeley Police Department Jail over the past 30 days.", "attribution": "City of Berkeley Police Department", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-12-26T16:35:07.000Z", "createdAt": "2016-02-10T20:59:41.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2017-10-22T22:16:23.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-12-26T16:35:07.000Z", "columns_name": ["Statute", "Race", "Subject", "Booking Date and Time", "Booking Agency", "Statute Description", "Arrest Date and Time", "Eyes", "Occupation", "Hair", "Weight", "Date Of Birth", "Age", "Disposition", "Sex", "Case Number", "Booking Number", "Statute Type", "Height"], "columns_field_name": ["statute", "race", "subject", "booking_date_and_time", "booking_agency", "statute_description", "arrest_date_and_time", "eyes", "occupation", "hair", "weight", "date_of_birth", "age", "disposition", "sex", "case_number", "booking_number", "statute_type", "height"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Calendar date", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["The statutory number section of the violation", "The race of the person booked", "The name of the person booked", "Date and time of the booking ", "FOR MORE INFO SEE THE .PDF ATTACHMENT UNDER THE ABOUT TAB. This field contains the booking agency\u2019s Originating Reporting Identifier (ORI).  Every law enforcement agency is assigned a unique ORI for identification purposes.  \n\nThe following are the ORI\u2019s of common agencies that transport bookings to the Berkeley City Jail:\n\n(CA0010000)\tAlameda County Sheriff's Office\n(CA0010200)\tAlbany Police Department\n(CA0010300)\tBerkeley Police Department\n(CA0010400)\tEmeryville Police Department\n(CA0012100)\tBART Police Department\n(CA0019700)\tUC Berkeley Police Department\n(CA0019970)\tCHP - Golden Gate\n(CA0073700)\tDept. of Alcoholic Beverage Control\n(CA034085G)\tDivision of Adult Parole Operations\n\nAny agency not listed above is identified as \u201cOTHER\u201d.\n", "A plain text summary description of the statute.  Expand the column to see the complete description.", "", "", "", "", "", "The date of birth of the person booked", "", "FOR MORE INFO SEE THE .PDF ATTACHMENT UNDER THE ABOUT TAB.  The Disposition describes how the detainee left the custody of the Berkeley Police Department Jail.  The following is a legend for disposition codes:\n\n(849(b) PC-RELEASE)\tNo prosecution requested\t\n(BAILED)\t\tReleased pursuant to bail bond\n(CITE-JAIL)\t\tCited at Jail, then Released\n(CITE-MEDICAL)\t\tCited at Jail, enroute medical\n(COURT BOOKING)\t\tCourt ordered booking, released\n(ENROUTE)\t\tEnroute to other agency\t\n(HAYWARD COURT)\tMoved to Hayward Courthouse\n(MEDICAL)\t\tMedical\trelease\n(NO COMPLAINT\t)\tNo complaint sought\n(NORTH COUNTY JAIL)\tMoved to Glenn Dyer Detention Facility\n(SANTA RITA JAIL)\t\tMoved to Santa Rita County Jail\n(SANTA RITA-MEDICAL)\tEnroute to Santa Rita Jail via \t\t\tmedical evaluation\n", "The sex of the person booked", "FOR MORE INFO SEE THE .PDF ATTACHMENT UNDER THE ABOUT TAB. The Case Number identifies the police report documenting the arrest", "The Booking Number is a sequential index number that identifies one booking from another. The first four numbers of the Booking Number designate the year, followed by a\nhyphen and then a sequential number generated by the\npolice Records Management System (RMS).", "The statutory code the statute number is found in. The following are common Statute Types:  (BMC)\tBerkeley Municipal Code, (BP) Business and Professional Code, (EC) Education Code, (GC) Government Code, (HN) \tHarbors and Navigations Code, (HS) Health and Safety Code, (PC) Penal Code, (VC) Vehicle Code, (WI)\tWelfare and Institutions Code", ""], "columns_format": [{"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"view": "date_time", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"view": "date_time", "align": "left"}, {}, {}, {}, {"precisionStyle": "standard", "noCommas": "false", "align": "left"}, {"view": "date", "align": "left"}, {"align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2017-10-22T22:16:23.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": ["public safety", "infrastructure", "politics"], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Public Safety", "domain_tags": ["agency", "arrest", "booking", "charges", "jail", "police", "statute"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Required-fields_One-Page-Narrative", "value": "Adults booked into the Berkeley Police Department Jail over the past 30 days"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.cityofberkeley.info", "license": "Public Domain U.S. Government"}, "permalink": "https://data.cityofberkeley.info/d/7ykt-c32j", "link": "https://data.cityofberkeley.info/Public-Safety/Berkeley-PD-Log-Jail-Bookings/7ykt-c32j", "owner": {"id": "tqdh-nm3t", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Police"}, "creator": {"id": "tqdh-nm3t", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Police"}}
